      <h1 style="font-size:1.8rem;line-height:1.2;">GEARWRENCH vs DEWALT Socket Set: 110 Pieces or 192?</h1>
    </div>

    <p>The short answer: the GEARWRENCH 110-piece at $115.58 is the set to buy if you work on your own car and want no skipped sizes. The DEWALT 192-piece at $152.99 wins if you want maximum coverage and a lifetime warranty to back it. The 82 extra pieces in the DEWALT box are not 82 extra jobs.</p>
